  'vehicle:vapid-police-car': ['The summary names it the Vapid Police Cruiser Stanier LE, based on the Ford Crown Victoria: four seats, about 1,400 kg, rear-wheel drive, five gears; seen in Trailer 1. A “Ghost” unmarked variant has its own record.'],
  'vehicle:gauntlet-interceptor': ['Reported as the Bravado Police Gauntlet Interceptor, based on the 2018 Dodge Challenger SRT Demon: two seats, about 2,150 kg, rear-wheel drive, five gears; modifiable only at compatible owned properties. Also in GTA Online.'],
  'vehicle:landstalker-xl-police': ['Reported as the Dundreary Police Landstalker XL, based on the fourth-generation Lincoln Navigator: four seats, about 2,500 kg, all-wheel drive, five gears; seen in the Extended Look.'],
  'vehicle:police-maverick': ['Reported as the returning Buckingham Police Maverick, based on the Eurocopter AS350B: four seats, about 6,500 kg, a game-file top speed of 160 km/h; seen in Trailer 1.'],
