  'vehicle:buzzard-attack-chopper': ['Reported as the returning Nagasaki Buzzard, an armed light helicopter based on the MD Helicopters AH-6 Little Bird: four seats, about 3,800 kg, five-blade rotor; seen in Trailer 2. Earlier: GTA V and GTA Online.'],
  'vehicle:maverick': ['Reported as the returning Buckingham Maverick, a civilian helicopter based on the Bell 206L LongRanger: four seats, about 6,500 kg; seen in official screenshots. It has appeared in most 3D and HD Universe games.'],
  'vehicle:sea-sparrow': ['Reported as the returning two-seat Sea Sparrow, drawing on the Sikorsky/Hughes/Schweizer 300 and Aérospatiale Alouette II, about 3,500 kg — the lightest helicopter listed; seen in Trailer 1. Earlier: Vice City, San Andreas, Vice City Stories and GTA Online.'],
