  'vehicle:swift': ['Reported as the returning Buckingham Swift, a fast executive helicopter drawing on the AgustaWestland AW109 and Bell 222: four seats, about 6,500 kg; seen in official screenshots. Earlier: The Ballad of Gay Tony, GTA V and GTA Online.'],
  'vehicle:valkyrie': ['Reported as the returning Buckingham Valkyrie from GTA Online, an armed helicopter drawing on the Bell UH-1 family (UH-1Y Venom, Bell 212/412): four seats, about 6,500 kg, rear bullet protection and several variants; seen in the Extended Look.'],

