  'vehicle:flatbed': ['Reported as the returning JoBuilt Flatbed, based on the 2004 Freightliner Century Class 112 (model ID flatbed): two seats, about 6,500 kg, all-wheel drive, five gears; people can stand on the deck. Seen in the Extended Look.'],
  'vehicle:mixer-4-axle': ['The summary describes the standard HVY Mixer, based on the Kenworth T800 — two seats, about 6,000 kg, rear-wheel drive, four gears — known only from the September 2022 development footage. This record is the four-axle variant.'],
