  'vehicle:dodo': ['Reported as the returning Mammoth Dodo floatplane, based on the de Havilland Canada DHC-2 Beaver: four seats, about 2,000 kg; seen in Trailer 1. Its floats let it use water in the Keys, lakes, rivers and islands. Earlier: GTA III, San Andreas and GTA V.'],
