  'vehicle:jet': ['Reported as a four-engine wide-body airliner mixing the Boeing 747-400 and 747-8 Intercontinental: about 38,000 kg, listed with two seats in vehicle data; seen in Trailer 2. Earlier: San Andreas (as the AT-400) and GTA V.'],
